{"4176860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "R Mate", "steam_appid": 4176860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R Mate is a pirate themed game taking place on an island after washing ashore there, surrounded by skeletons and other hostile creatures. You can build a base and craft to help your survival or just try exploring to find booty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight skeletons and humanoids. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading NPC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest NPC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building unique structures, defensive walls, decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee and ranged combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting weapons, clothing, and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather and Day/Night cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree and leveling system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities to unlock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different types of weapons to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follower NPC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flyable Heli, build the platform after finding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned Feature:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle system boats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R Mate is a pirate themed game taking place on an island after washing ashore there, surroun